<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN" data-design-system="antd">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{title}}</title>
<!--
  UX 与需求分析报告（离线、零依赖）。
  由 `dsh-plugin-harness-cli ux` 生成，整体报告永远覆盖仓库里的全部任务；
  分析维度按 用户与场景 → 需求拆解 → 任务关联 → 体验流程 → 异常与恢复 → 状态与反馈
  → 可用性 → 文档完整性 排序。标「待确认」的位置需补文档或逐条关闭，报告不替产品拍板。
-->
<style>
  :root {
    --ant-color-primary: #1677ff;
    --ant-color-success: #52c41a;
    --ant-color-warning: #faad14;
    --ant-color-error: #ff4d4f;
    --ant-color-text: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88);
    --ant-color-text-secondary: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);
    --ant-color-text-tertiary: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
    --ant-color-border: #d9d9d9;
    --ant-color-border-secondary: #f0f0f0;
    --ant-color-bg-container: #ffffff;
    --ant-color-bg-layout: #f5f5f5;
    --ant-color-fill-secondary: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    --ant-border-radius: 6px;
    --ant-border-radius-lg: 8px;
    --ant-font-size: 14px;
    --ant-line-height: 1.5714;
    --ant-box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03), 0 1px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    margin: 0; background: var(--ant-color-bg-layout); color: var(--ant-color-text);
    font: var(--ant-font-size)/var(--ant-line-height) -apple-system, "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
  }
  a { color: var(--ant-color-primary); text-decoration: none; }
  code { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 12px;
         background: var(--ant-color-fill-secondary); border-radius: 4px; padding: 0 4px; }
  .layout { display: flex; min-height: 100vh; }
  .sider { width: 224px; flex: 0 0 224px; background: #001529; color: rgba(255,255,255,.65); padding: 20px 0; position: sticky; top: 0; height: 100vh; overflow-y: auto; }
  .sider .logo { margin: 0 20px 20px; color: #fff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; }
  .sider .logo small { display: block; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; color: rgba(255,255,255,.45); }
  .sider a { display: block; margin: 4px 10px; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: var(--ant-border-radius); color: rgba(255,255,255,.65); font-size: 13px; }
  .sider a:hover, .sider a.active { background: var(--ant-color-primary); color: #fff; }
  .main { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .header { background: var(--ant-color-bg-container); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ant-color-border-secondary); padding: 20px 32px 16px; }
  .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.4; }
  .header .meta { margin-top: 8px; color: var(--ant-color-text-tertiary); font-size: 13px; display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .content { padding: 24px 32px 48px; max-width: 1180px; }
  section { margin-bottom: 32px; scroll-margin-top: 16px; }
  h2 { font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 12px; padding-left: 10px; border-left: 4px solid var(--ant-color-primary); line-height: 1.3; }
  h3 { font-size: 15px; margin: 18px 0 8px; }
  .card { background: var(--ant-color-bg-container); border: 1px solid var(--ant-color-border-secondary); border-radius: var(--ant-border-radius-lg); padding: 16px 20px; box-shadow: var(--ant-box-shadow); }
  .conclusion { background: #f0f5ff; border: 1px solid #adc6ff; border-radius: var(--ant-border-radius-lg); padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--ant-color-text-secondary); font-size: 13px; }
  .conclusion strong { color: var(--ant-color-text); }
  .cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
  .stat { background: var(--ant-color-bg-container); border: 1px solid var(--ant-color-border-secondary); border-radius: var(--ant-border-radius-lg); padding: 14px 16px; }
  .stat .label { color: var(--ant-color-text-secondary); font-size: 13px; }
  .stat .value { margin-top: 6px; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 600; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .stat .value small { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--ant-color-text-tertiary); margin-left: 4px; }
  .stat.warn .value { color: var(--ant-color-warning); }
  .stat.error .value { color: var(--ant-color-error); }
  .stat.ok .value { color: var(--ant-color-success); }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: var(--ant-color-bg-container); border: 1px solid var(--ant-color-border-secondary); border-radius: var(--ant-border-radius-lg); overflow: hidden; }
  thead th { background: #fafafa; text-align: left; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ant-color-text-secondary); white-space: nowrap; }
  th, td { padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ant-color-border-secondary); vertical-align: top; font-size: 13px; }
  tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  tbody tr:hover td { background: #fafafa; }
  .tag { display: inline-block; padding: 0 7px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px; border: 1px solid transparent; white-space: nowrap; }
  .tag-pass { color: #389e0d; background: #f6ffed; border-color: #b7eb8f; }
  .tag-todo { color: #d48806; background: #fffbe6; border-color: #ffe58f; }
  .tag-high { color: #cf1322; background: #fff1f0; border-color: #ffa39e; }
  .tag-mid { color: #d46b08; background: #fff7e6; border-color: #ffd591; }
  .tag-low { color: #0958d9; background: #e6f4ff; border-color: #91caff; }
  .tag-kind { color: #531dab; background: #f9f0ff; border-color: #d3adf7; }
  .tag-status { color: var(--ant-color-text-secondary); background: #fafafa; border-color: var(--ant-color-border); }
  ul.plain { margin: 6px 0 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  ul.plain li { margin: 4px 0; }
  .muted { color: var(--ant-color-text-tertiary); }
  .empty { color: var(--ant-color-text-tertiary); background: #fafafa; border: 1px dashed var(--ant-color-border); border-radius: var(--ant-border-radius-lg); padding: 18px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; }
  .quote { border-left: 3px solid var(--ant-color-border); padding: 4px 12px; color: var(--ant-color-text-secondary); white-space: pre-wrap; }
  .split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  details.closed { margin-top: 12px; }
  details.closed summary { cursor: pointer; color: var(--ant-color-text-secondary); font-size: 13px; padding: 6px 0; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .layout { display: block; }
    .sider { position: static; width: auto; height: auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; padding: 10px; gap: 4px; }
    .sider .logo { width: 100%; margin: 4px 8px 8px; }
    .sider a { margin: 0; }
    .content { padding: 16px; }
    .header { padding: 16px; }
    .split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  @media print {
    .sider { display: none; }
    body { background: #fff; }
    .content { max-width: none; padding: 0; }
    .header { border-bottom: 2px solid #000; }
    section { break-inside: avoid; }
    .card, .stat, table { box-shadow: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="layout">
  <aside class="sider">
    <div class="logo">UX 分析报告<small>harness-cli · {{today}}</small></div>
    <a href="#summary" class="active">摘要</a>
    <a href="#overview">项目概览</a>
    <a href="#users">用户与场景</a>
    <a href="#requirements">需求拆解</a>
    <a href="#relations">任务关联</a>
    <a href="#flow">体验流程</a>
    <a href="#recovery">异常与恢复</a>
    <a href="#states">状态与反馈</a>
    <a href="#heuristics">可用性检查</a>
    {{#if hasCustom}}<a href="#project-needs">项目需求</a>{{/if}}
    <a href="#risks">风险与待确认</a>
    <a href="#next">下一步</a>
  </aside>
  <div class="main">
    <header class="header">
      <h1>{{title}}</h1>
      <div class="meta">
        <span>范围：{{scopeLabel}}</span>
        <span>生成：{{today}}</span>
        <span>报告：{{reportPath}}</span>
        {{#if globalPath}}<span>整体：{{globalPath}}</span>{{/if}}
        {{#if hasCustom}}<span>需求清单：{{requirementsPath}}</span>{{/if}}
      </div>
    </header>
    <main class="content">

      <section id="summary">
        <h2>摘要</h2>
        <div class="cards">
          <div class="stat"><div class="label">覆盖任务</div><div class="value">{{summary.tasks}}<small>个</small></div></div>
          <div class="stat"><div class="label">拆出需求</div><div class="value">{{summary.requirements}}<small>条</small></div></div>
          <div class="stat ok"><div class="label">维度已分析</div><div class="value">{{summary.dimensionsDone}}<small>/ {{summary.dimensionsTotal}}</small></div></div>
          <div class="stat warn"><div class="label">可用性待补</div><div class="value">{{summary.todo}}<small>项</small></div></div>
          <div class="stat {{#if summary.blocking}}error{{/if}}{{#unless summary.blocking}}ok{{/unless}}"><div class="label">待确认（阻断）</div><div class="value">{{summary.blocking}}<small>处</small></div></div>
          <div class="stat ok"><div class="label">已确认关闭</div><div class="value">{{summary.resolved}}<small>项</small></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
          <strong>怎么读这份报告</strong>
          <ul class="plain">
            <li>整体报告永远分析<strong>全部任务</strong>；选中的任务只决定 `--apply` 回写谁（单任务报告每次都会刷新），不会让整体报告缩水。</li>
            <li>分析按维度优先级推进：用户与场景 → 需求拆解 → 任务关联 → 体验流程 → 异常与恢复 → 状态与反馈 → 可用性 → 文档完整性。</li>
            <li>缺口有稳定编号：补完文档重跑 ux，已修好的自动消失；文档证明不了的用 <code>ux --resolve &lt;编号&gt;</code> 逐条关闭。</li>
            <li>「可用性检查」判断的是<strong>文档里能不能找到依据</strong>，不是给界面打分。</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <h3>维度进度（按优先级）</h3>
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>优先级</th><th>维度</th><th>结论</th><th>状态</th><th>待确认 / 待补</th><th>已关闭</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          {{#each dimensions}}
            <tr>
              <td>{{priority}}</td>
              <td><strong>{{label}}</strong></td>
              <td>{{conclusion}}</td>
              <td><span class="tag tag-{{tone}}">{{status}}</span></td>
              <td>{{gapCount}}{{#if todoCount}} / {{todoCount}}{{/if}}</td>
              <td>{{resolvedCount}}</td>
            </tr>
          {{/each}}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </section>

      <section id="overview">
        <h2>项目概览</h2>
        <div class="card">
          <ul class="plain">
            <li><strong>项目：</strong>{{project.name}}{{#if project.version}}（{{project.version}}）{{/if}}</li>
            <li><strong>定位：</strong>{{project.positioning}}</li>
            {{#if project.stack}}<li><strong>技术栈：</strong>{{project.stack}}</li>{{/if}}
            {{#if project.runtime}}<li><strong>运行环境：</strong>{{project.runtime}}</li>{{/if}}
            <li><strong>任务：</strong>{{summary.tasks}} 个；<strong>关联：</strong>{{summary.relations}} 组{{#if hasCustom}}；<strong>项目需求：</strong>{{projectRequirements.count}} 条{{/if}}</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        {{#if taskRows}}
        <h3>任务清单</h3>
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>任务</th><th>状态</th><th>总进度</th><th>关联任务</th><th>要解决的问题</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          {{#each taskRows}}
            <tr>
              <td><strong>{{name}}</strong></td>
              <td><span class="tag tag-status">{{status}}</span></td>
              <td>{{progress}}%</td>
              <td>{{#if relatedText}}{{relatedText}}{{/if}}{{#unless relatedText}}—{{/unless}}</td>
              <td>{{goal}}</td>
            </tr>
          {{/each}}
          </tbody>
        </table>
        {{/if}}
        {{#unless taskRows}}<div class="empty">仓库里还没有任务，本次只分析项目需求。</div>{{/unless}}
      </section>

      <section id="users">
        <h2>用户与场景</h2>
        <div class="conclusion"><strong>分析结论：</strong>{{analysis.users}}</div>
        <div class="split">
          <div>
            <h3>谁在用</h3>
            {{#if users}}
            <table>
              <thead><tr><th>对象</th><th>角色 / 说明</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody>
              {{#each users}}<tr><td>{{task}}</td><td>{{text}}</td></tr>{{/each}}
              </tbody>
            </table>
            {{/if}}
            {{#unless users}}<div class="empty">还没有角色线索，已列入待确认（优先补「参与角色」）。</div>{{/unless}}
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>典型场景</h3>
            {{#if scenarios}}
            <table>
              <thead><tr><th>对象</th><th>场景</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody>
              {{#each scenarios}}<tr><td>{{task}}</td><td>{{text}}</td></tr>{{/each}}
              </tbody>
            </table>
            {{/if}}
            {{#unless scenarios}}<div class="empty">还没有可读的典型场景，已列入待确认（优先补）。</div>{{/unless}}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="requirements">
        <h2>需求拆解</h2>
        <div class="conclusion"><strong>分析结论：</strong>{{analysis.requirements}}</div>
        {{#if requirements}}
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>编号</th><th>来源</th><th>类型</th><th>需求</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          {{#each requirements}}
            <tr>
              <td>{{id}}</td>
              <td>{{task}} · {{source}}</td>
              <td><span class="tag tag-kind">{{kind}}</span></td>
              <td>{{text}}</td>
            </tr>
          {{/each}}
          </tbody>
        </table>
        {{/if}}
        {{#unless requirements}}<div class="empty">没有拆出需求：先补提案的范围与验收，或写一段项目需求。</div>{{/unless}}
      </section>

      <section id="relations">
        <h2>任务关联</h2>
        <div class="conclusion"><strong>分析结论：</strong>{{analysis.relations}}</div>
        {{#if relations}}
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>关联</th><th>类型</th><th>依据</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          {{#each relations}}
            <tr>
              <td><strong>{{from}}</strong> → <strong>{{to}}</strong></td>
              <td><span class="tag tag-{{tone}}">{{kindLabel}}</span></td>
              <td>{{evidence}}</td>
            </tr>
          {{/each}}
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p class="muted" style="margin:8px 0 0">在任意任务文档里写「关联任务：任务名」可显式声明；`ux --apply` 会一并刷新关联任务的 UX 复核区块，改动时请一起核对两边的角色、术语与流程。</p>
        {{/if}}
        {{#unless relations}}<div class="empty">没有发现任务之间的关联；需要时在 flow.md 写「关联任务：任务名」。</div>{{/unless}}
      </section>

      <section id="flow">
        <h2>体验流程</h2>
        <div class="conclusion"><strong>分析结论：</strong>{{analysis.flow}}</div>
        {{#if flows}}
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>任务</th><th>主流程</th><th>流程图</th><th>异常路径</th><th>状态流转</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          {{#each flows}}
            <tr>
              <td><strong>{{task}}</strong></td>
              <td>{{main}}</td>
              <td>{{#if hasDiagram}}有{{/if}}{{#unless hasDiagram}}无{{/unless}}</td>
              <td>{{exceptions}} 条</td>
              <td>{{states}} 条</td>
            </tr>
          {{/each}}
          </tbody>
        </table>
        {{/if}}
        {{#unless flows}}<div class="empty">没有任务流程可读。</div>{{/unless}}
      </section>

      <section id="recovery">
        <h2>异常与恢复</h2>
        <div class="conclusion"><strong>分析结论：</strong>{{analysis.recovery}}</div>
        {{#if exceptions}}
        <ul class="plain">{{#each exceptions}}<li><strong>{{task}}</strong>：{{text}}</li>{{/each}}</ul>
        {{/if}}
        {{#unless exceptions}}<div class="empty">异常路径还没写，最容易在这里漏体验；已列入待确认（优先补）。</div>{{/unless}}
      </section>

      <section id="states">
        <h2>状态与反馈</h2>
        <div class="conclusion"><strong>分析结论：</strong>{{analysis.states}}</div>
        {{#if states}}
        <ul class="plain">{{#each states}}<li><strong>{{task}}</strong>：{{text}}</li>{{/each}}</ul>
        {{/if}}
        {{#unless states}}<div class="empty">状态流转还没写，加载 / 空 / 失败 / 锁定要各有去向；已列入待确认。</div>{{/unless}}
      </section>

      <section id="heuristics">
        <h2>可用性检查</h2>
        <div class="conclusion"><strong>分析结论：</strong>{{analysis.usability}}</div>
        {{#if heuristics}}
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>对象</th><th>检查项</th><th>结论</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          {{#each heuristics}}
            <tr>
              <td>{{task}}</td>
              <td>{{name}}</td>
              <td><span class="tag tag-{{tone}}">{{status}}</span></td>
              <td>{{note}}</td>
            </tr>
          {{/each}}
          </tbody>
        </table>
        {{/if}}
        {{#unless heuristics}}<div class="empty">没有可检查的内容。</div>{{/unless}}
      </section>

      {{#if hasCustom}}
      <section id="project-needs">
        <h2>项目级需求</h2>
        <div class="conclusion"><strong>分析结论：</strong>共 {{projectRequirements.count}} 条项目需求，本次新增 {{projectRequirements.newCount}} 条；已写入 <code>{{requirementsPath}}</code>，后续重跑不会丢失。</div>
        <div class="split">
          <div>
            <h3>目标用户</h3>
            {{#if projectRequirements.users}}
            <ul class="plain">{{#each projectRequirements.users}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}</ul>
            {{/if}}
            {{#unless projectRequirements.users}}<div class="empty">没点明目标用户；补「谁在什么场景下用」。</div>{{/unless}}
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>典型场景</h3>
            {{#if projectRequirements.scenarios}}
            <ul class="plain">{{#each projectRequirements.scenarios}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}</ul>
            {{/if}}
            {{#unless projectRequirements.scenarios}}<div class="empty">没写场景；补「当……时，用户要……」。</div>{{/unless}}
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>需求分类</h3>
        {{#if projectRequirements.requirements}}
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>需求</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          {{#each projectRequirements.requirements}}<tr><td><span class="tag tag-kind">{{kind}}</span></td><td>{{text}}</td></tr>{{/each}}
          </tbody>
        </table>
        {{/if}}
      </section>
      {{/if}}

      <section id="risks">
        <h2>风险与待确认</h2>
        {{#if risks}}
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>级别</th><th>风险</th><th>来源</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          {{#each risks}}
            <tr>
              <td><span class="tag tag-{{tone}}">{{level}}</span></td>
              <td>{{text}}</td>
              <td>{{source}}</td>
            </tr>
          {{/each}}
          </tbody>
        </table>
        {{/if}}
        {{#unless risks}}<div class="empty">没有识别到高优先级风险。</div>{{/unless}}

        {{#if gaps}}<h3>待确认清单（按维度优先级）</h3>{{/if}}
        {{#if gaps}}
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>编号</th><th>维度</th><th>级别</th><th>对象</th><th>缺口</th><th>怎么补</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          {{#each gaps}}
            <tr>
              <td><code>{{id}}</code></td>
              <td><span class="tag tag-low">{{dimensionLabel}}</span></td>
              <td><span class="tag tag-{{tone}}">{{level}}</span></td>
              <td>{{task}}</td>
              <td>{{item}}{{#if blocking}}（阻断分析完成）{{/if}}</td>
              <td>{{hint}}</td>
            </tr>
          {{/each}}
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p class="muted" style="margin:8px 0 0">补文档后重跑 ux，已修好的条目会自动消失；文档无法自动证明的，用 <code>ux --resolve &lt;编号&gt; --by "确认人"</code> 逐条关闭。</p>
        {{/if}}
        {{#unless gaps}}{{#if resolvedGaps}}<h3>待确认清单</h3><p class="muted">待确认项已全部关闭。</p>{{/if}}{{/unless}}

        {{#if resolvedGaps}}
        <details class="closed">
          <summary>已确认关闭 {{summary.resolved}} 项</summary>
          <table>
            <thead><tr><th>编号</th><th>维度</th><th>对象</th><th>缺口</th><th>确认人</th><th>时间</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
            {{#each resolvedGaps}}
              <tr>
                <td><code>{{id}}</code></td>
                <td>{{dimensionLabel}}</td>
                <td>{{task}}</td>
                <td>{{item}}</td>
                <td>{{by}}</td>
                <td>{{resolvedAt}}</td>
              </tr>
            {{/each}}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </details>
        {{/if}}
      </section>

      <section id="next">
        <h2>下一步</h2>
        <div class="card">
          <ul class="plain">
            {{#each nextSteps}}<li>{{text}}</li>{{/each}}
          </ul>
          <p class="muted" style="margin-bottom:0">报告由 `dsh-plugin-harness-cli ux` 生成；改任务文档后重跑即可刷新。完成分析后，在 DSH 里选择「更新任务」或「创建任务」继续任务流程。</p>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
